  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組能以經典的 3D 風格渲染玩家手部，該風格常見於早期 Minecraft 的經典動畫中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🔵 依賴模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>&nbsp;（2.4 版或更新）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🟢 相容模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D Skin Layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🔴 不相容模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftras-fresh-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Player</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>由 J9 STUDIOS 贊助</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252f1052.pro%252fReadDragonightsPrologue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/cdn.dragonights.com/partner_ad.png&n=-1\" alt=\"sponsor\"></a></p>",
